            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Musa Aron o layiok lenyena, “Enteyier nena kiri te kutukaji o lng'obor le ntumo ninosinoso teine o nena mukateni naatii atua ina kikapu oo nkishorot enkiteleikinoto oo nkaik, anaa enaitanapishe nanu, ajo, Aron o layiok lenyena ooinos nena; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore entoki naleku too nkiri o too mukateni nipejoo te nkima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimipuopuo intae aaipang te kutukaji eilo ng'obor le ntumo too nkolong'i naapishana, o metaba anaa neishunye nkolong'i enkiteleikinoto oo nkaik, amu nkolong'i naapishana ine nkiteleikinoto oo nkaik te iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaa enataase taata, eitanapishe Olaitoriani metaasi pee eitobiri olning'o lo osotua te nkaraki intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te kutukaji e ilo ng'obor le ntumo entobik teine dama o kewarie too nkolong'i naapishana, intabayaya nena naaitanapishe Olaitoriani, pee miyeye ake; amu nena nanu aaitanapaki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas Aron o layiok lenyena nena tokitin pooki naaitanapishe Olaitoriani aimunye Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
